{title: Ti Geli Tenva Rim Jhim}
{artist: Hridaynath Mangeshkar}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Ti geli tewha rim [D] jhim,        pa [Bm] aus nina [D] dat hot [A] aa
[A] Meghaant adakali kirane,        ha [D] surya sodawit ho [Bm] ta
[A] Ti aai hoti [G] mhanuni,        [A] ghanawyaakul mi hi [G] radalo
[A] Ti aai hoti [D] mhanuni,        [A] ghanawyaakul mi hi [G] radalo
[A] Tyaaweli waara [G] saawadh,        paa [D] chola udawit ho [Bm] ta
[A] Anganaat gamale majala,        sam [D] pale baalapan [A] maajhe
[A] Khidakiwar dhurakat tewha,        kan [D] dil ekata [Bm] hota
